Machine Learning Kya Hai? (Hinglish Explanation)

Machine Learning (ML) ek aisi technology hai jisme computers khud data se seekhte hain, bina har chhoti cheez ke liye explicitly program kiye jaane ke.

Andrew Ng is introduction mein batate hain ki Machine Learning hum roz use karte hain, aksar bina realize kiye.

Kuch Real-Life Examples:

🔍 Google/Bing Search Jab aap search karte ho, jaise "How do I make a sushi roll?", search engine machine learning use karke decide karta hai ki kaunse web pages sabse relevant hain aur unhe top par dikhata hai.

📸 Instagram aur Snapchat Jab app aapke friends ko photos mein pehchan leti hai aur automatically unhe tag karne ka suggestion deti hai, woh machine learning ki wajah se hota hai.

🎬 Movie Recommendations Agar aapne Star Wars dekhi hai aur Netflix ya kisi streaming service ne similar movies suggest ki, toh recommendation system machine learning par based hota hai.

🎤 Voice-to-Text aur Voice Assistants Jab aap phone se bolkar message likhte ho:

"Hey Andrew, how's it going?"

ya Siri/Google Assistant se kehte ho:

"Play a song by Rihanna"

toh machine learning aapki voice ko samajhkar usse text ya command mein convert karta hai.

📧 Spam Detection Agar koi email aaye:

"Congratulations! You've won a million dollars!"

toh email service machine learning ki madad se identify kar sakti hai ki yeh spam hai aur use spam folder mein bhej deti hai.

Sirf Consumer Apps Tak Hi Limited Nahi

Machine Learning industries aur businesses mein bhi bahut use ho rahi hai.

🌍 Climate Change Wind turbines ki efficiency improve karne aur zyada electricity generate karne ke liye machine learning use ki ja rahi hai.

🏥 Healthcare Doctors ko diseases diagnose karne mein help karne ke liye ML systems hospitals mein use ho rahe hain.

🏭 Manufacturing Factories mein cameras aur computer vision systems products ko inspect karte hain aur defects detect karte hain. Isse quality control better hota hai.

Simple Definition

Machine Learning = "The science of getting computers to learn without being explicitly programmed."

Matlab computer ko har rule manually batane ki jagah, usse data diya jata hai aur woh patterns seekhkar khud decisions lena seekhta hai.

Short Summary

Machine Learning ek technology hai jo computers ko data se seekhne ki capability deti hai. Iska use search engines, social media, movie recommendations, voice assistants, spam filters, healthcare, climate solutions aur factories mein hota hai. Is course ka goal aapko ML ko samjhana aur practical coding ke through implement karna sikhana hai. 🚀🤖
